@startuml
 title stm — Collector queue entry
 [*] --> New : eligible run discovered
 New --> Scanning : pending status acknowledged and scan intent persisted
 New --> Result : failed tests or provenance validation error
 Scanning --> Result : definitive gate or explicit scan error
 Scanning --> Result : restart reconciliation without resubmission
 Result --> Result : GitHub status publication fails
 Result --> Done : exact-SHA status acknowledged and state persisted
 Done --> [*]
 note right of Scanning
Persist task identity and working directory
before invoking external scanner
end note
 note right of Result
Unknown submission is an error requiring
operator reconciliation, never a blind retry
end note
@enduml
